Y2  - 2026/09/04
N2  - Abstract When engineers design a system, they must design both the product and the process that will develop it. Accordingly, systems engineers must separately write requirements for the product and the process. Stating these requirements in separate documents should make it easier to get the requirements right and manage the requirements when either the product or the process requirements change.
